              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Scope 1: fuel burned on site and refrigerant leaks. Scope 2: electricity and heat bought, at each country's average factor (location-based); market-based is shown beside it. Scope 3: purchases, upstream fuel and grid losses, freight, flights, landfill waste and the lifetime electricity of the pumps sold. Totals are location-based.",
